{"seq":14,"slug":"security-engineering","title":"安全工程","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/security-engineering","rating":{"composite":4.11,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.47,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"安全工程-简介\">安全工程 简介</h1><p>本 hub 从<strong>软件工程师的视角</strong>讲安全：如何在日常开发中识别 Web 漏洞、正确使用密码学原语、设计认证授权、把安全活动嵌入开发与交付流程。它不追求红队攻防的纵深，也不替代密码学的数学推导，而是给「写代码的人」一份可直接落地的工程化安全手册。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>安全相关主题在仓库中分散在多个 hub，各有侧重，避免混淆：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>视角</th>\n<th>何时看它</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>本 hub（安全工程）</strong></td>\n<td>开发者工程实践</td>\n<td>写业务代码时如何防漏洞、用加密、做鉴权、嵌安全到流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../../cybersecurity-applied/threat-modeling/\">网络安全应用 56_cybersecurity-applied</a></td>\n<td>攻防 / 蓝队红队</td>\n<td>威胁建模、渗透测试、事件响应、OSINT、网络防御</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../cryptography-fundamentals/\">密码学基础 22_cryptography-fundamentals</a></td>\n<td>数学原理</td>\n<td>想理解 AES/RSA/ECC/哈希「为什么安全」、算法内部构造</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../authentication-authorization/\">认证与授权 46_authentication-authorization</a></td>\n<td>身份体系专题</td>\n<td>深入 OAuth/OIDC/RBAC/ABAC/策略引擎的完整设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../software-supply-chain-security/\">软件供应链安全 82_software-supply-chain-security</a></td>\n<td>供应链专题</td>\n<td>SBOM、SLSA、制品签名、构建溯源的纵深</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../secrets-configuration-management/\">密钥与配置管理 52_secrets-configuration-management</a></td>\n<td>配置工程</td>\n<td>Vault、动态密钥、密钥轮换、密钥扫描的运维落地</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：<strong>本 hub 是入口与全景</strong>，覆盖面广但每条主线点到为止；想深入某一支，顺着上表跳到对应专题 hub。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>全栈 / 后端工程师（最常见入口）</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><code>1_web-security-basics</code>（XSS → CSRF → 注入 → SSRF）——日常最高频的漏洞</li>\n<li><code>3_auth</code>（OAuth 2.0 → JWT → SSO → RBAC）——几乎每个系统都要做鉴权</li>\n<li><code>2_cryptography</code>（对称/非对称 → 哈希签名 → 证书 PKI → 密钥管理）——正确用密码学，不要自己造轮子</li>\n<li><code>5_supply-chain-security</code>（依赖 → 容器 → SAST/DAST → 零信任）</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>DevOps / 平台工程师</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><code>5_supply-chain-security</code> 全章——CI/CD 与容器是你的主战场</li>\n<li><code>4_security-architecture</code>（SDL → 审计渗透 → 日志 IDS → 合规）</li>\n<li><code>2_cryptography</code> 的证书与密钥管理两节</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>安全 / 应用安全工程师</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>先通读 <code>4_security-architecture</code> 建立流程框架</li>\n<li><code>1_web-security-basics</code> + <code>3_auth</code> 作为漏洞与鉴权的攻防基线</li>\n<li>跳转到 <a href=\"../../cybersecurity-applied/threat-modeling/\">56_cybersecurity-applied</a> 深入攻防与事件响应</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>HTTP 与 Web 基础</strong>：Cookie、请求头、同源策略——见 <a href=\"../computer-networking/application-layer/http-protocol\">HTTP 协议</a></li>\n<li><strong>基本网络模型</strong>：TCP/IP 与 TLS 握手——见 <a href=\"../computer-networking/network-security/tls-and-https\">TLS 与 HTTPS</a></li>\n<li><strong>数据库与 SQL</strong>：理解注入需要先懂查询语义——见 <a href=\"../database-systems/sql-mastery/ddl-and-dml\">DDL 与 DML</a></li>\n<li>不需要密码学数学背景：本 hub 把密码学当「正确使用的工具」讲，原理推导留给 <a href=\"../cryptography-fundamentals/\">22_cryptography-fundamentals</a></li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"web-security-basics","title":"Web 安全基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/security-engineering/web-security-basics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"xss","title":"XSS 攻击与防御","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/security-engineering/web-security-basics/xss"},{"seq":2,"slug":"csrf","title":"CSRF 与请求伪造","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/security-engineering/web-security-basics/csrf"},{"seq":3,"slug":"injection","title":"SQL 注入与 NoSQL 注入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/security-engineering/web-security-basics/injection"},{"seq":4,"slug":"ssrf","title":"SSRF 与服务端攻击","url":"/l-doc-b